00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:08.300
<v Orlando>Okay, excellent. And so some of the verbs that we had: we had the
verb <lang pt-BR>deitar</lang>, which does not mean "to date" somebody, by the way.

00:02:08.350 --> 00:02:10.300
<v Valdo>It means "to go to bed".

00:02:10.350 --> 00:02:13.550
