00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:15.800
<v Orlando><lang pt-BR>Deitar</lang>, which is not reflexive.

00:02:15.850 --> 00:02:17.250
<v Orlando>Then we had <lang pt-BR>levantar</lang>,

00:02:17.620 --> 00:02:19.050
