<v Valdo>Right?

00:02:19.600 --> 00:02:20.090
<v Valdo>Exactly.

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:21.050
<v Orlando>Not reflexive.

00:02:21.100 --> 00:02:24.730
<v Orlando>Then we had the verb <lang pt-BR>sentar</lang>, "to sit down".

