<v Orlando>And we saw the verb <lang pt-BR>esquecer</lang>, which means "to forget".

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:55.000
<v Orlando>And every one of those, there's no reflexive that goes with it.

00:02:56.100 --> 00:02:56.590
